  leaf [editor#round.go editor#round_test.go *terminal#1]
dock left open=true [*explorer]
dock bottom open=true [*problems]
focus terminal#1
=== ⌃W F: float the terminal
main
  leaf [*editor#round.go editor#round_test.go]
dock left open=true [*explorer]
dock bottom open=true [*problems]
float 200,120 640x400 [*terminal#1]
focus terminal#1
=== ⌃`: the terminal in the drop-down
main
  leaf [*editor#round.go editor#round_test.go]
dock left open=true [*explorer]
dock bottom open=true [*problems]
dropdown open=true [*terminal#1]
focus terminal#1
